    "description_raw": "All affected creatures are veiled with a commonplace appearance.\n\nThis appearance varies based on the viewer, but is always an ordinary member of that viewer’s race, ethnicity, or nationality.\n\nThis familiarity grants a +2 bonus on Diplomacy checks attempted by affected targets against those not affected by the spell.\n\nCreatures with an attitude of unfriendly or hostile toward an affected target can attempt a Will save to disbelieve the effect the first time they encounter that target.",
